  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 67,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahama wakadi muntu mununu mukoke, ne Yehowa wakasankisha Abalahama mu malu andi onso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahama wakambila muhika wandi mukulu, wakadi mulami wa bintu biandi bionso ne, Ndi nkutendekena ne, Uteke tshianza tshiebe muinshi mua tshibelu tshianyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nenkutshihishe kudi Yehowa, Nzambi wa diulu ne wa buloba, ne wewe kuangatshidi muanʼanyi mulume mukashi wa bana bakashi ba Bena Kanâna babidi bashikame nʼabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi uye biebe kuanyi, kudi bana betu, wangatshile muanʼanyi Isaka mukashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhika wandi wakamukudimuna di ne, Abu biahidia mukashi kundonda ku buloba ebu, netuhingane ne muan ebe mulume ku buloba buwakumuka, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalahama wakamuambila ne, Udimuke, kuyi ne muanʼanyi kabidi kuakua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa, Nzambi wa mulu, wakangumusha ku nsubu wa tatu wanyi ne ku buloba buakandelabo, wakabambila, wakandaya ne, Nempe tunkanunuina biebe buloba ebu yeye mene neatume muanjelo wandi ku mpala kuebe, ne wewe newangatshile muanʼanyi mukashi kuakua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biahidia mukashi kukulonda, hashishe, munda muebe nemu ikale mutoke ku kuditshiha eku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhi ka wakateka tshianza tshiandi muinshi mua tshibelu tshia Abalahama, mukelenge wandi, wakaditshiha bua bualu ebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhika wandi wakangata nyama ya tumelo dikumi mu tshisumbu tshia tumelo bia mukelenge wandi, wakaya ne biuma bia mukelenge wandi bia mishindu yonso mu tshianza tshiandi, wakabika, wakaya ku buloba bua Mesopotamia, ku musoko wa Naho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye Wakabikila tumelo binu hanshi ku butshika bua musoko hehi ne mushimi wa mai dilolo ha diba diyaya bakashi bua kusunabo mai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wa mukelenge wanyi Abalahama, ndi nkulomba ne, Ungendeshe dikasa dimpe lelu, ufuile mukelenge wanyi Abalahama luse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tangila, hantshidi muimane hehi ne mushimi wa mai, ne bana bakashi ba bena musoko bakadi balua bua kusunabo mai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "witabushe ne nsongakashi undi ngambila ne, Ndi nkutendekena ne, Utule mulondo webe wa mai, umpe mai a kunua, yeye angandamune di ne, Nua biebe, nennuishe tumelo biebe kabidi, nunku yeye mene ikale mukashi uwakasunguila muntu webe Isaka, nunku nemmanye ne wewe wakufuila mukelenge wanyi luse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, hakadiye wakula, tangilai, Lebeka wakadi mulela kudi Betuele, muana mulume wa Mileka, mukashi wa Naho, muanʼabo ne Abalahama, wakaluhuka ne mulondo wa mai ha diaha diandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsongakashi eu wakadi ne mpala muimpe be, wakatshidi kamama, kayi muanze kumanyibua kudi mulume, yeye wakahueka ku mushimi wa mai, wakasuna mulondo wandi tente, wakabanda kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhika wakaya lubilu kudiye, wakamuakidila, wakamuambila ne, Ndi nkutendekena ne, Umpeku tuima tukese bia meme kunua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Nue biebe, mukelenge wanyi, yeye wakatula mulondo wandi lubilu mu tshianza tshiandi, wakamunuisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakashikisheye kumunuisha mai, yeye wakamba ne, Nensunyine tumelo biebe mai kabidi to ne hukutatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakaya lubilu, wakahongoluela mai mu luvu lunene, wakaya lubilu ku mushimi kabidi, wakasunyina tumelo biandi tuonso mai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulume eu wakamutangila talalâ, wakadi welangana meji munda bua kumanyeye ne, Yehowa wakungendesha dikasa bimpe, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakashikisha tumelo kunua mai, mulume eu wakahatula kakanu ka or ka bujitu bua tshituha tshia nshekele, ne nkanu ibidi ya ku maboko ya bujitu bua nshekele dikumi kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamukonka ne, Wewe udi muana wa nganyi? Ndi nkusengelela ne, Ungambile Udi ne muaba mu nsubu wa tatu webe bua tuetu kulalamu, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamukudimuna di ne, Ndi muana wa Betuele, muana mulume wa Mileka, wakaleleleye Naho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamuambila kabidi ne, Tudi ne mashinde ne manvua a bungi, ne miaba ya kulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulume eu wakinyika mutu wandi, wakatendelela Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wa mukelenge wanyi Abalahama, atumbishibue, yeye kakumushila mukelenge wanyi luse luandi ne bulelela buandi, hanakadi mu nshila Yehowa wakandombola ku nsubu wa bana babo ne mukelenge wanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsongakashi wakaya lubilu, wakambila ba mu nsubu wa mamu andi malu au. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lebeka wakadi ne muanʼabo wa balume dina diandi Labana, Labana wakaya lubilu kudi mulume wakadi ku mushimi wa mai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatangileye kakanu ka ku diulu ne nkanu ya ku maboko a muanʼabo mukashi, ne hakunvueye mei a Lebeka muanʼabo mukashi ne, Mulume au wakungambila nunku, yeye wakaya kudi mulume wakadi muimane ne tumelo hehi ne mushimi wa mai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Ubuele, wewe udi musankishibue kudi Yehowa, udi muimane ha bule bualu kai? Bualu bua nakumana kukulongoluela nsubu ne muaba wa tumelo tuebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulume wakabuela mu nsubu, wakumusha biseba ha nyima ha tumelo, wakalua ne mashinde ne manvua bia tumelo, ne mai a kuvuwa nʼau makasa andi ne makasa a bantu bakadi nʼandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakateka bintu bia kudia ku mpala kuandi, kadi yeye wakamba ne, Tshiena ndia diambedi tshiyi muanze kunuambila bualu bunakuluila Labana wakamuambila ne, Ambaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Ndi bianyi muhika wa Abalahama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakatamba kusankisha mukelenge wanyi, yeye wakulua muntu munene, wakumuka bisumbu bia mikoko ne bia ngombe, ne argent ne or, ne bahika balume ne bahika bakashi, ne tumelo ne nyama ya mpunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sala, mukashi wa mukelenge wanyi, wakamulelela muana mulume hakadiye muntu mununu, yeye wakadia muana eu bintu bionso bidiye nʼabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wanyi wakuntshihisha ne, Kuangatshidi muanʼanyi mulume mukashi wa bana bakashi ba Bena Kanâna badi mu buloba bundi mushikame, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi uye biebe ku nsubu wa tatuʼanyi ne kudi bana betu, wangatshileku muanʼanyi mulume mukashi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakambila mukelenge wanyi ne, Ahu, biahidia mukashi kundonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakungambila ne, Yehowa, undi ngendakana ku mpala kuandi, neatume muanjelo wandi nʼebe, neakuendeshe dikasa dimpe, ne wewe newangatshile muanʼanyi mulume mukashi kudi bana betu ne kudi ba mu nsubu wa tatu wanyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, munda muebe nemuikale mutoke ku kuditshiha eku, hawaya kudi bana betu, biahidiabo kukuha mukashi, munda muebe nemuikale mutoke ku kuditshiha eku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanakufika lelu ku mushimi wa mai, nakuamba ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wa mukelenge wanyi Abalahama, biwasua kungendesha dikasa dimpe mu nshila unaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tangila, hantshidi muimane hehi ne mushimi wa mai, witabushe ne nsongakashi ulualua bua kusuneye mai undi ngambila ne, Ndi nkusengelela ne Umpeku tuima tua kunua mu mulondo webe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yeye neangandamune dî ne, Nua biebe, nennuishe tumelo biebe kabidi, ka yeye mene ikale mukashi wakasunguila Yehowa muana mulume wa mukelenge wanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diambedi tshiyi muanze kushikisha kuamba mei au mu mutshima wanyi, Lebeka wakaluhuka ne mulondo wa mai ha diaha diandi, wakaya ku mushimi wa mai, wakasuna mai, meme nakamuambila ne, Umpeku mai a kunua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakatula mulondo wandi lubilu ha diaha diandi, wakamba ne, Nua biebe, nensunyine tumelo biebe mai kabidi, nunku nakunua ne yeye wakumusha tumelo mai kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakumuebesha ne, Wewe udi muana wa nganyi? Yeye wakungambila ne, Ndi muana wa Betuele, muana wa Naho, wakamulelela Mileka, nunku nakumuluatshisha kakanu ka ku diulu diandi ne nkanu ya ku maboko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuinyika mutu wanyi, nakutendelela Yehowa, nakutumbisha Yehowa, Nzambi wa mukelenge wanyi Abalahama, wakandombola mua kuya mu nshila muakane bua kuangatshila muana mulume wa mukelenge wanyi mukashi kudi muana wa muanʼabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katataka binuasua kulesha mukelenge wanyi luse ne bulelela, nungambile, ne binuahidia, nungambile kabidi: nunku meme ndi mua kuya ku tshianza tshia balume anyi ku tshianza tshia bakashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labana ne Betuele bakamba ne, Bualu ebu buakufuma kudi Yehowa, tuetu katuena mua kukuambila dî dibi anyi dî dimpe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tangila, Lebeka udi ku mpala kuebe, umuangate, uye nʼandi, yeye neikale mukashi wa muana mulume wa mukelenge webe bu muakamba Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua muhika wa Abalahama mei abo, yeye wakakukuila mpala wandi hanshi ku mpala kua Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhika wa Abalahama wakahatula bilenga bia argent ne bia or ne bilulu, Wakabikila kudi Lebeka, yeye wakaha muanʼabo mulume ne mamu wandi kabidi bintu bia mushinga mukole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye ne balume bakadi nʼandi bakadia, bakanua, bakalala butuku abu, bakabika ne dinda, yeye wakabambila ne, Nuntume kudi mukelenge wanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muanʼabo mulume ne mamu wa Lebeka bakamba ne, Nsongakashi anji kushala matuku makese, nansha dikumi, hashishe yeye neaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabambila ne, Kanumpumbishi, bualu bua Yehowa wakungendesha dikasa dimpe, nuntume kudi mukelenge wanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bobo bakamba ne, Netubikile nsongakashi, netumuebeshe yeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabikila Lebeka, bakamuebesha ne, Udi musue kuya ne muntu eu, anyi? Yeye wakabakudimuna ne, Nyaya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bakatuma muanʼabo Lebeka ne muena mudimu wandi wa bakashi ne muhika wa Abalahama ne bantu bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakavudishila Lebeka disanka, bakamuambila ne, Wewe muanʼetu mukashi, wikale nkambua mukashi wa binunu bia mbombo ya bantu, ne tunkanunuina tuebe tuhiane buloba bua bantu badi nʼatu lukuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.60"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lebeka wakabika ne bena mudimu bandi ba bakashi, bakabanda ha nyima ha tumelo, bakalonda muntu wa Abalahama, yeye wakangata Lebeka, wakaya mu nshila wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka wakalua mu nshila wa ku Bê-laha-loi, bualu bua yeye wakadi ushikama ku buloba bua ku Sude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka wakaya mu budimi dilolo bua kutendelela, wakabandisha mesu andi, ne monai, tumelo tuakadi tulua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lebeka wakabandisha mesu andi kabidi ne hakatangileye Isaka, yeye wakatuluka ha nyima ha kamelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakakonka muhika ne, Eu mulume kai udi wendakana mu budimi bua kusambakana nʼetu? Muhika wakamukudimuna dî ne, Nyeye mukelenge wanyi Lebeka wakangata tshilulu tshikudika, wakatshiteka ku mishiku yandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
