        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka wakalua nʼandi mu ntenta wa mamu wandi, Sala, yeye wakangata Lebeka, wakalua mukashi wandi Isaka wakamunanga, ne mutshima wandi wakasambibua bua lufu lua mamu wandi.",
